      "findings": "Chicago Fed Letter 521 proves the University of Michigan Index understates consumer sentiment by 25-30 index points in 2024-2026. This disconnect arises from a combination of web survey methodology mode transition (~14.5 pts) and 'vibes' inflation salience (~7.2 pts)."
    }
